---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact DevToolbench"
  description="Get in touch with the DevToolbench team — report bugs, suggest features, or ask questions about our free developer tools."
  path="/contact"
  keywords={[
    'contact devtoolbench',
    'devtoolbench support',
    'developer tools contact',
  ]}
>
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Have a question, found a bug, or want to suggest a new tool? Reach out — we read
      everything and respond when we can.
    </p>

    <section class="channels">
      <div class="channel">
        <h2>GitHub Issues</h2>
        <p>
          The fastest way to report a bug or request a feature is to open an issue on the
          project's GitHub repository. Include the tool name, what you expected to happen,
          and what actually happened (a screenshot helps).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="channel">
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>
          For general questions, security concerns, or anything else, send us an email at:<br />
          <a href="mailto:hello@devtoolbench.dev" class="mono email-link">
            hello@devtoolbench.dev
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="channel">
        <h2>Response times</h2>
        <p>
          We're a small project run in our spare time, so we can't guarantee fast response
          times — but we do read and respond to every message. Bug reports affecting tool
          accuracy or security get priority.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="security">
      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        If you believe you've found a security vulnerability — especially anything that could
        compromise the k-anonymity model in the breach checker or expose the PageSpeed API
        key — please report it via email rather than a public issue. We take security
        reports seriously and will respond promptly.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .page-content { max-width: 46rem; padding: 2rem 0; }
    .page-content h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    .page-content .lead { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 1rem; max-width: 42rem; }
    .page-content h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--good); }
    .page-content p { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.9375rem; }
    .channels { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .channel {
      background: var(--bg-raised);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
    .channel h2 { font-size: 1.0625rem; margin-top: 0; }
    .channel p { margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }
    .email-link { font-size: 1.0625rem; color: var(--good); }
    .security {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.2);
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .security h2 { color: var(--bad); margin-top: 0; }
  </style>
</Layout>
